})⟩ \\\\  & =⟨1-\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}},\\,1+\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}}⟩ \\\\ {r}^{′}(1) & =⟨1-\\frac{1}{{1}^{2}},\\,1+\\frac{1}{{1}^{2}}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨1-1,\\,1+1⟩ \\\\  & =⟨0,\\,2⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, a tangent vector to the given curve at the point where $t=1$  is  $⟨0,\\,2⟩.$" 13194139535036 true] [17592186328094 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328095 13194139535036 true] [17592186328094 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328096 13194139535036 true] [17592186328094 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328097 13194139535036 true] [17592186328094 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328098 13194139535036 true] [17592186328094 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328099 13194139535036 true] [17592186328094 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535036 true] [17592186328094 1041 "selection" 13194139535036 true] [17592186328094 1104 #edb/ref 17592186328099 13194139535036 true] [17592186328094 1110 #uuid "f6396df1-1582-59bb-8966-ab67747b03a9" 13194139535036 true] [17592186328095 1034 "⟨-2,\\,1⟩" 13194139535036 true] [17592186328095 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535036 true] [17592186328095 1111 #uuid "d240ba9e-2fd9-5462-8d88-96f96a61ba91" 13194139535036 true] [17592186328096 1034 "⟨1,\\,1⟩" 13194139535036 true] [17592186328096 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535036 true] [17592186328096 1111 #uuid "f3870c7a-22b3-54a0-917c-0829eef5ce87" 13194139535036 true] [17592186328097 1034 "⟨2,\\,0⟩" 13194139535036 true] [17592186328097 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535036 true] [17592186328097 1111 #uuid "46f83cbc-f3be-5c80-b3a2-24179c3cd4e4" 13194139535036 true] [17592186328098 1034 "⟨2,\\,-2⟩" 13194139535036 true] [17592186328098 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535036 true] [17592186328098 1111 #uuid "7badfff3-9e9b-53b6-92bf-6b50d51a7f9d" 13194139535036 true] [17592186328099 1034 "⟨0,\\,2⟩" 13194139535036 true] [17592186328099 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535036 true] [17592186328099 1111 #uuid "80db05c6-bce8-5ffa-80e6-b6e77df4cdb2" 13194139535036 true] [17592186328100 1017 #edb/ref 17592186328101 13194139535036 true] [